Cell["\<\
A substrate is the graph a construction runs on. Every figure in this \
documentation is drawn on one, so an example starts with one line and no \
setup code.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"ef854f8c-44b3-45bd-a409-59f9560b5c78"],

Cell["The roster has five classes:", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"c2fc85a7-226b-4593-ac36-3ba1725047cc"],

